### Query index
GET {{esUrl}}/_cat/indices?v
Content-Type: application/json


### Index sorting
GET {{esUrl}}/_cat/indices/master_*?v&s=docs.count:desc
Content-Type: application/json


### Query index mappings
GET {{esUrl}}/globex_dms_device_log
Content-Type: application/json


### Delete index
DELETE {{esUrl}}/master_lms_login_log
Content-Type: application/json


### Update index default shards and replicas
POST {{esUrl}}/_template/default_template
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "index_patterns": [
    "*"
  ],
  "settings": {
    "number_of_shards": 1,
    "number_of_replicas": 0
  }
}



### Query index mappings
GET {{esUrl}}/globex_lms_oper_log/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match_all": {}
  },
  "sort": [
    {
      "createTime": {
        "order": "desc"
      }
    }
  ]
}